title: 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_영문
---
{name()}: *Huff... puff...*
(I overslept again...)
(Attending a first-period class is seriously the hardest thing ever...)
<<play 공통_웅성>>
Prof: Alright, let's take attendance.
Prof: Student number three hundred, forty, two.
{name()}: 3..4...2....
(After gasping for air while typing in my attendance code, I finally noticed the person slumped over the desk next to me.)
(It was ASan.)
<<show san_idle>>
<<play san_sound>>
{name()}: You okay? You look exhausted today.
ASan: .....
ASan: Wh-what?
ASan: Oh..... I guess I stayed up too late studying last night...
(With that, ASan buried her face back into the desk.)
<<choice 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문 "I'll buy you something." 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문 "I'm broke.">>
(Should I use some Gold to buy her something from the convenience store?)
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
<<if get("gold") >= 20>>
    <<jump 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_커피o_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_커피x_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_부정1_영문
---
<<jump 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_커피x_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_커피o_영문
---
(Since I happen to have some cash on me, I should go buy her a coffee.)
<<change gold -20>>
<<play 공통_의자>>
<<wait 2>>
{name()}: Here.
<<play 공통_컵>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
<<show san_shock>>
ASan: .....?
(ASan looks around with eyes as wide as a rabbit's.)
ASan: Wait, are you actually giving this... to me....?
{name()}: Yeah.
{name()}: You looked totally wiped out, so I picked it up for you.
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: Seriously? You're really giving it to me?
{name()}: Oh... do you not drink coffee?
ASan: N-no, it's not that!!!!!!!!!!!
ASan: That's not what I meant.
ASan: ..........
ASan: It's just... I've never really had anyone do this for me before.....
<<show san_smile>>
<<change lvSan 15>>
<<like 신아산>>
{name()}: It's no big deal. Drink up and good luck with your studies!
ASan: ..........
{name()}: You look cool when you're focused, you know.
ASan: Thank you.... really...
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Next time you're sleepy, just tell me.
ASan: I'll slap a bass solo right in your ear to wake you up!!!!!!!
(After cracking a ridiculous joke, ASan sipped her coffee and faced forward.)
(It's my first time seeing her smile so brightly.)
(...I should buy her stuff more often.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_1교시_강의실_신아산_커피x_영문
---
(................)
(I'm out of money.....)
(I look over at her to try and wake her up, but she looks truly exhausted..)
{name()}: I'll record the lecture and send it to you later.
{name()}: Don't worry about it and just get some sleep.
ASan: ... Thanks....
(The class ended like that, and ASan headed to the club room, saying she needed a bit more sleep.)
<<end>>
===